| `\breakseq{entry:visual.duck\_rabbit}`{=latex} | `\breakseq{engineering+limitation+gap;}`{=latex} `\breakseq{brugger1999duckrabbit,}`{=latex} `\breakseq{gregory1997visual}`{=latex} | DOI: `\breakseq{not\_applicable;}`{=latex} URL: `\breakseq{data/evidence\_matrix.json}`{=latex} | `\breakseq{snapshot\_validated;}`{=latex} `\breakseq{offline\_snapshot}`{=latex} | The entry instantiates a controllable ambiguous-figure stimulus family. Engineering basis: Parameterized ambiguous silhouette; not a pixel-identical reproduction of a historical plate. Limitation: The generator verifies geometry and luminance, not bistable reports. Missing contract: none |
| `\breakseq{entry:visual.simultaneous\_contrast}`{=latex} | `\breakseq{engineering+limitation+gap;}`{=latex} `\breakseq{gregory1997visual}`{=latex} | DOI: `\breakseq{not\_applicable;}`{=latex} URL: `\breakseq{data/evidence\_matrix.json}`{=latex} | `\breakseq{snapshot\_validated;}`{=latex} `\breakseq{offline\_snapshot}`{=latex} | The physical center patches are matched while surround luminance differs. Engineering basis: Equal central patches on unequal luminance surrounds. Limitation: Display calibration and observer adaptation are not modeled. Missing contract: none |
