| `\breakseq{entry:audio.missing\_fundamental}`{=latex} | `\breakseq{engineering+limitation+gap;}`{=latex} `\breakseq{zatorre2005missing}`{=latex} | DOI: `\breakseq{not\_applicable;}`{=latex} URL: `\breakseq{data/evidence\_matrix.json}`{=latex} | `\breakseq{snapshot\_validated;}`{=latex} `\breakseq{offline\_snapshot}`{=latex} | The nominal fundamental component is absent from the canonical spectrum. Engineering basis: Harmonic components are synthesized while the nominal fundamental is omitted. Limitation: Pitch completion is an observer-level inference. Missing contract: none |
